Package: com.huhansibuxin.keybagcacheskip
Name: KeybagCacheSkip
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Stops keybagd from rebuilding its ~306MB backup-keys cache on every launch (fixes the ~20s 100% CPU spike / heat on iOS 16 rootless & roothide)
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
